任せします。\nよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tyosuke22/works/76", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/307673b4/uploads/origins/2d7ce8d2-0776-44ad-abff-ea8069993f71?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f2e45add2d4aecd1b3a7a3bfd51f9cf3", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tyosuke22/works/75", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/aa9d16aa/uploads/origins/d926d973-431c-444f-8a55-125df9bfaa0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2dd996f47af035bd01b66882d173f0ce", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめてのskebでして。使い方や金額相場が間違えてたらごめんなさい\n山紫水明(依田芳乃と藤原肇)をお願いしたく参りました。衣装は和装希望ですが、ちょすけてんての描きやすいものでよきでして。\n名刺用途なので息抜きの落書きレベルでも十分でして。ちょすけてんての山紫水明が見たいオタクでした。ぶおお。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tyosuke22/works/74", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d295d2f7/uploads/origins/1d45fce0-b554-4fc2-ab41-b19dbaf0d728?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0cde16b514c03f1fbd91f1bfca3695cb", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tyosuke22/works/73", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/407a83eb/uploads/origins/095d3103-2eb7-4c4d-8d46-fb63a65cf4d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e281790304a2e6d08dabfcec13acd117", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tyosuke22/works/72", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4a2e3f70/uploads/origins/3e5460bb-159b-46f1-9341-79c86207320a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3efc4d842644d2bde7b0154d51790be0", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "有輝です。新規リクエストが可能になったのでリクエストさせていただきます。\n\n深紅に包まれて+の佐久間まゆちゃんをお願い致します。\n太ももの絶対領域が映りお膝の辺りくらいまでお願い致します。\n\nかなり衣装が複雑な模様ではありますが、もしよろしければご検討の程よろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FgsspzyVQAAec_R?format=jpg&name=large", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tyosuke22/works/71", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3814be79/uploads/origins/1adce552-26a9-421c-8c76-c46b9bb097e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6b0f52983dc100fe9a88c68b11ae6fa9", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}